ada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/08/31/2475985/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"急いで書いたから汚かったかもしれないけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二十何個か\n中田のサインボール受け取ってくれたかた\n大事にしてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\nゲームクリアで\nえりか様が\nヘリコプターで神宮まで来るサプライズ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"吐息のメソッドでは\n浴衣を着たり \n君の名は希望では\n花火があがりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/08/31/2475985/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏ですね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心の薬は\nえりか様のピアノ生演奏＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンコール内のMCで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみんの登場\n松井さんとのテレビ電話もありました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/08/31/2475985/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の全国ツアーでは\n初の野外"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂は雨女多くて\n今年の全ツなんか地方全公演で雨を降らせたけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"野外の今日に限って\n当日の朝は降ってたのに\n本番には止んでて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんがてるてる坊主を作ってくださったり\n晴れるように願っててくれたおかげだな\nって思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/08/31/2475985/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/08/31/2475985/0005.jpeg","